#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:4
msgid ""
"The License section is for automating the application of Licenses to "
"Instances while provisioning. Licenses can be added to |morpheus| and then "
"attached to images. |morpheus| will then apply the license to Instances "
"provisioned using the images with license attached. Licenses can be "
"configured for single or multiple Tenants."
msgstr ""
"El Licencia sección es para automating el application de Licencias a "
"Instancias while aprovisionamiento. Licencias puede ser agregado a "
"|morpheus| y then attached a images. |morpheus| va a then aplicar el "
"licencia a Instancias provisioned usando el images con licencia attached. "
"Licencias se puede configurar para single o múltiples Inquilinos."

