msgstr "Save Changes"

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:37
msgid "Provisioning with Licenses"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento con Licencias"

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:39
msgid ""
"When a Virtual Image is added to a license, |morpheus| will automatically "
"apply the License to Instances configured with the Virtual Image during "
"provisioning, including Instance Types with a Node Type that is configured "
"with the Virtual Image, or if the image is selected when using generic Cloud"
" Instances types (VMware, AWS, Nutanix, Openstack etc). Virtual Images can "
"be removed from a License by editing the License."
msgstr ""
"Cuando a Virtual Image es agregado a a licencia, |morpheus| va a "
"automáticamente aplicar el Licencia a Instancias configurado con el Virtual "
"Image durante aprovisionamiento, incluyendo Tipos de Instancia con a Node "
"Tipo ese es configurado con el Virtual Image, o si el image es seleccionado "
"cuando usando generic Nube Instancias tipos (VMware, AWS, Nutanix, Openstack"
" etc). Virtual Images puede ser removed desde a Licencia por editing el "
"Licencia."

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:42
msgid "Managing Licenses"
msgstr "Managing Licencias"

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:44
msgid ""
"Created Licenses details are displayed in the License page, including the "
"number of copies applied per License, the Tenants added to the License, and "
"the Virtual Images attached to the License."
msgstr ""
"Creado Licencias detalles son mostrado en el Licencia página, incluyendo el "
"número de copies aplicado per Licencia, el Inquilinos agregado a el "
"Licencia, y el Virtual Images attached a el Licencia."

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:46
msgid ""
"The Name, Version, Copies, Description, Virtual Images and Tenant "
"Permissions are editable but selecting the `Actions` dropdown on a License."
msgstr ""
"El Nombre, Version, Copies, Description, Virtual Images y Inquilino Permisos"
" son editable pero selecting el `Actions` menú desplegable en a Licencia."

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:48
msgid ""
"License Types, Keys, Org Names and Full Names are not editable after a "
"license has been created."
msgstr ""
"Licencia Tipos, Keys, Org Names y Full Names son no editable después de a "
"licencia ha sido creado."

#: ../../administration/settings/licenses.rst:50
msgid "License can also be removed using the `Actions` dropdown on a License."
msgstr ""
"Licencia puede también be removed usando el `Actions` menú desplegable en a "
"Licencia."
